# Where the rendered animation clips and their posters are written and
# published from: the images/ directory of a checkout of
# jmrplens/phonometry-assets. Leave unset to use the sibling checkout
# ../phonometry-assets, which `make assets` clones. The clips never go into
# this repository (scripts/assets_dir.py explains why). A GPU node is not
# configured here: it is an entry of the hosts file (see the guide page on
# running simulations on a node).
# PHONOMETRY_ASSETS_DIR=/path/to/phonometry-assets/images
